# Slideshow scene (rsx5 limits audit, 2026-11-09): Sami's save "5. Karma's a Bitch" (work\saves\slideshow-save),
# the city seen from above where the old 1024-entry texture cache turned the game into a 4-10 fps slideshow.
# Anchor = the game's first world frame (> 2500 draws, PS3RECOMP_ENG_WORLD_MARK, not in the first 40 s after the
# first present); then the camera turns right in steps, each view held still while it is measured.
# Run: tools\fast.ps1 -Tag X -Steps tools\fast_slideshow.steps [-Extra "PS3RECOMP_LIMITS=1"]
#! seconds 330
#! savefrom work\saves\slideshow-save\gamedata
#! worldmark 40
#! anchor_range 30:280
#! windows 2:12,15:24,27:36,39:48,51:60
#! pad w12:0x800000:1.5,w24:0x800000:1.5,w36:0x800000:1.5,w48:0x800000:1.5
anchorfile 280
at 8
shot a8
at 20
shot a20
at 32
shot a32
at 44
shot a44
at 56
shot a56
at 62
close
